    "reason": "[ev-6b09d547f030] is only the one-line changelog title \"feat: Upgrade notifications engine (#22273)\". It gives no before or after version and says nothing about what behaves differently. The surrounding Changelog › Features section adds nothing about it, and no upgrade-guide text mentions it. The evidence therefore cannot support \"behavior-changed\" (which needs a stated change in semantics) or \"requirement-changed\" (which needs a version constraint), and it does not clearly show that the engine is a separate product rather than an internal library. To decide, we would need the PR #22273 details or upgrade-guide text naming the versions and any change operators would notice.",
